      "title": "Remove support for converting from really old preferences",
      "message": "Remove support for converting from really old preferences\n\nset_pref() has been simplified to remove support for upgrading really old preferences.  They mostly fall into 2 categories:\n1. Upgrades from the Ethereal days (and if you haven't updated to Wireshark by now, don't know what to say)\n2. Putting a lot of \"global GUI preferences\" into the GUI module (commit e0e533d643fbac41ddea4dc7495dc4fed221aff9, technically from the SVN days, circa 2012)\n\nAlso removed the unknown_prefs member from e_prefs structure because it wasn't being used (set only)\n",
      "author_name": "Michael Mann",
